@startuml US_3_2_4_C2_Logica
title US 3.2.4 - Lógica de autorização

component AuthGuard as "AuthGuard\nclient-side roles"
component AuthSvc as "AuthService\nroles normalizados"
component Middleware as "NetworkRestrictionMiddleware\nAPI"
component Authz as "ASP.NET Authorization\n[Authorize]/Policies"
database DB as "PortContext\nAppUsers/Roles"

AuthGuard --> AuthSvc : role check
Middleware --> DB : validar user ativo + roles
Authz --> DB : role claims via cookie

@enduml
